--TEST--
hovering the name in an attribute's own declaration answers nothing, because the declaration is already on screen, like a class's own name, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Page {
    attribute Pa<|>th on method { path: string }

    public function render(): string;
}

class Home implements Page {
    #[Path(path: "/")]
    public function render(): string { return "home"; }
}
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
none
